        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
            "volume": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Scouting complete. I can confirm that the enemies pursuing us have been eliminated."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "We've managed to break through their encirclement. We'll be at the outskirts of Chernobog soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Even though the enemies we defeated today were just a small portion of the whole force..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "At least we're safe for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Thank you for what you did back there. I am forever in your debt."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Don't say stuff like that. I don't have the right to ask the Radiant Knight for repayment anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Anyway, let's talk about that sniper, Nearl."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Putting aside the destructive power of that ballista..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "I think... he might have set up several turrets in advance, as well as other automatically-firing devices."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "I was targeted from different directions... but I only saw one sniper."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "I had the same feeling."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "The first and second shots exploded at about the same time, but there was a noticeable delay between them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "Those shots weren't fired from the same repeating ballista. At least, when we returned fire, we weren't targeting the same sniper."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Ace, did you realize something?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "I can't say for sure. What if the enemy was moving so quickly... to the point of basically being in several places at once?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "There's no way anyone could move that quickly. I can't even imagine how it'd be possible."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "We can't underestimate how dangerous Reunion is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "It was that malicious brat who ordered the sniper to go after you. He didn't even call upon the sniper when he was attacking us..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Looks like that disgusting personality of his is backed up by some real power."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_014_riope",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ace",
        "text": "However, he never attacked us, even when he was angry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "So either his combat capabilities are lacking, or he simply chose to not display his true abilities yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Just seeing his commanding abilities in action... makes me highly suspicious."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "He was commanding his troops like puppets..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "In any case, we're no longer in territory that he controls."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Nearl... Thank you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "If not for your timely arrival, we would have been in grave danger."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "I was just following the plan we agreed on beforehand."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "You were the one who asked me and Ace to make adjustments depending on the situation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "You solved your own problem."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "On my way here, I saw the extent of Reunion's atrocities, and I had doubts about their power."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "What if I stopped to engage their forces?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "What if I helped Ursus defend against Reunion?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "What if I stayed back at the rendezvous point, waiting for you to come to me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1#7",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "...If I was the one who called the shots, there's no saying how much worse the outcome could have been."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "I'm not good at thinking several steps ahead. The only way I know to get what I want is to keep fighting."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Amiya, I was only performing my duties, but you have the ability to end the crisis."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "You earned this victory, so have some more confidence in yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Miss Nearl..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
            "name2": "char_148_nearl_1#6",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Hehe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "This person standing next to you must be the Doctor, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That's right. But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_130_doberm_ex"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Dobermann",
        "text": "Every time we meet someone, Amiya has to repeat the story about how the Doctor is suffering from amnesia. What a pain..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "One of my friends lost her memories as well. I'm sure you two will get along."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "After all, you should understand how precious living in the present is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Mhm...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_148_nearl_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "Let's get going, everyone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nearl",
        "text": "We still have to escort the Doctor to Rhodes Island."
    },
